<title>UK: Chiroscience H1 losses widen.</title>
<headline>Chiroscience H1 losses widen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.4 loss	     vs 8.1 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p>  Pretax		    7.3 loss	     vs 5.5 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   4.7		    vs 2.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Chiroscience Group Plc, one of the U.K.'s leading drug research companies, said it has selected an asthma compound, D4418, to enter clinical trials and will select an MMP inhibitor cancer drug for development before the end of the year.  </p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest (receivable)  1.0		    vs 0.8</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  7.3 loss	     vs 5.5 loss</p>
<p> Retained		   7.3 loss	     vs 5.5 loss</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
